@startuml
autonumber
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

actor "Клиент" as Client
participant "API Gateway" as Gateway
participant "Application Service" as AppService
database "Application DB" as AppDB
queue "Kafka" as Kafka
participant "Notification Service" as Notif
participant "Scoring Service" as Scoring
database "Scoring DB" as ScoreDB
participant "BKI Service" as BKI
participant "БКИ (внешнее)" as ExtBKI

== 1. Создание заявки ==
Client -> Gateway : POST /applications
activate Gateway
Gateway -> AppService : Создать заявку
activate AppService

AppService -> AppDB : INSERT applications (PENDING)
activate AppDB
AppDB --> AppService : OK
deactivate AppDB

AppService -> Kafka : Publish: application.created
AppService --> Gateway : 201 Created
deactivate AppService
Gateway --> Client : 201 Created (Заявка создана)
deactivate Gateway

== 2. Уведомление о создании ==
Kafka ->> Notif : Consume: application.created
activate Notif
Notif --> Client : Email "Заявка создана"
deactivate Notif

== 3. Асинхронный скоринг ==
Kafka ->> Scoring : Consume: application.created
activate Scoring

Scoring -> BKI : Запрос в БКИ
activate BKI
BKI -> ExtBKI : POST /check
activate ExtBKI

alt Успешный ответ
    ExtBKI --> BKI : 200 OK (Данные)
    BKI -> ScoreDB : INSERT scoring_result (OK)
    BKI --> Scoring : Результат
    Scoring -> Kafka : Publish: scoring.completed
else Ошибка / Таймаут
    ExtBKI --> BKI : Timeout / 500
    BKI -> ScoreDB : INSERT scoring_result (ERROR)
    BKI --> Scoring : Ошибка
    Scoring -> Kafka : Publish: scoring.failed
end
deactivate ExtBKI
deactivate BKI
deactivate Scoring

== 4. Обновление статуса ==
Kafka ->> AppService : Consume: scoring.completed / failed
activate AppService
AppService -> AppDB : UPDATE applications (APPROVED / DENIED)
activate AppDB
AppDB --> AppService : OK
deactivate AppDB

AppService -> Kafka : Publish: status.changed
deactivate AppService

== 5. Уведомление о решении ==
Kafka ->> Notif : Consume: status.changed
activate Notif
Notif --> Client : Email "Решение по заявке"
deactivate Notif

@enduml